ace. If someone in your party has their own water activity, they will need to launch at the public boat launch by the Heffley Recreational site and you can meet up on the lake. Please note dogs are not permitted with activity rentals. Just check in with the store to fill out a waiver, pay for your activity and put down a deposit. Heffley Lake provides excellent fishing for any type of angler whether it be trolling, fly fishing, still fishing or ice fishing. The lake is 7.5km long and approx. 90' at its","photo":"https://irp.cdn-website.com/2b197d7f/dms3rep/multi/opt/Pic+4-1920w.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Wildlife Viewing","desc":null,"photo":"https://irp.cdn-website.com/2b197d7f/dms3rep/multi/opt/mathew-schwartz-NEvS5lHyrlk-unsplash+copy-1920w.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":3}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","cover":"https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/726987969_18055243637773878_3363117651633734263_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=SGczd47H8cYQ7kNvwEoqarc&_nc_oc=AdrZ-xuDfoMN4WO69e_6YQdF4eAVFpTMIHMELqfEqg1utYNGvBmyXIKgp_hzpn19wUQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=bp-D7UKP8BNuMTAE7mylyw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKT7uYGUXRmBLhlknJ9RFqO8oFdi4BJJOGTlxV12w8TDCTBxotzKL2UqSWNEOYY5r_ZKhUZUG4uiA&oh=00_AQI5ZUZHuvOgt3hfaIA9E0fLeEA3rMW1lCMiAV6IxNFfpg&oe=6AA8FEE5","photos":["https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/726987969_18055243637773878_3363117651633734263_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=SGczd47H8cYQ7kNvwEoqarc&_nc_oc=AdrZ-xuDfoMN4WO69e_6YQdF4eAVFpTMIHMELqfEqg1utYNGvBmyXIKgp_hzpn19wUQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=bp